  "answer_text": "**\"Still in Love with You\"** is a song by the legendary country music duo **Brooks & Dunn**. \n\nHere is everything you need to know about the song, including its background, lyrics, and an interesting solo connection.\n\n---\n\n### **Song Overview**\n* **Album:** *Brand New Man* (Brooks & Dunn\u2019s debut studio album)\n* **Release Year:** 1991\n* **Written By:** Kix Brooks, Ronnie Dunn, and Don Cook\n* **Produced By:** Don Cook and Scott Hendricks\n\n*Brand New Man* was a massive success for the duo, producing four consecutive number-one singles (\"Brand New Man,\" \"My Next Broken Heart,\" \"Neon Moon,\" and \"Boot Scootin' Boogie\"). While \"Still in Love with You\" wasn't released as a radio single, it remains a beloved deep cut for fans of 90s neotraditional country. \n\n---\n\n### **Lyrics**\n\n**[Verse 1]**\nMy taxi cab is waiting\nWish I could hold you one last time\nAfter all we've had together\nThere's gotta be a better way\nOf telling you goodbye\n\n**[Chorus]**\nIf I had a horse, I'd ride off in the sunset\nIf I had wings, I'd fly off in the sky so blue\nIf I had the time, I'd spend my whole life dreaming\nBut I'd wake up, still in love with you\n\n**[Verse 2]**\nBe in Baton Rouge by morning\nHope you're missing me by then\nI'd like to be the kind of memory\nThat makes you want to take me back\nIn your arms again...\n\n**[Chorus]**\nIf I had a horse, I'd ride off in the sunset\nIf I had wings, I'd fly off in the sky so blue\nIf I had the time, I'd spend my whole life dreaming\nBut I'd wake up, still in love with you\n\n**[Bridge]**\nSome nights when you get lonely\nWill you still remember me?\n\n**[Guitar Solo & Key Change]**\n\n**[Chorus]**\nIf I had a horse, I'd ride off in the sunset\nIf I had wings, I'd fly off in the sky so blue\nIf I had the time, I'd spend my whole life dreaming\nBut I'd wake up, still in love with you\nYeah, I'd wake up, still in love with you\n\n---\n\n### **An Alternative Connection: \"Re-Dunn\" (2020)**\nIf you are thinking of a more recent track, Ronnie Dunn (the voice of Brooks & Dunn) released a solo cover of the classic Hank Williams song **\"I Can't Help It (If I'm Still in Love with You)\"**. It was featured on his 2020 solo album, *Re-Dunn*, which consisted entirely of covers of classic country and rock songs.",
